{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "map",
  "title": "Map",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 23.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A small slippy map over OpenStreetMap tiles: routes with the travelled part in the accent, the vehicle where it is, and pins for the places that matter. It draws only the tiles in view and always credits the map data in the corner.",
    "id": "Peta geser kecil di atas tile OpenStreetMap: rute dengan bagian yang sudah ditempuh berwarna aksen, kendaraan di posisinya, dan pin untuk tempat yang penting. Hanya menggambar tile yang terlihat dan selalu mencantumkan kredit data peta di sudut."
  },
  "titleId": "Map",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A boat crossing under way",
        "desc": "The leg follows the great circle, bowed gently so it reads as a crossing over water. The travelled part draws in on first view, then the boat settles, turned along its path. Drag, scroll, pinch or use the buttons; focus the map and use the arrow keys and plus or minus.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 340px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"BPBD logistics boat from Dermaga Canti to Pulau Sebesi, 65 percent of the way\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"directions_boat\",\"label\":\"Logistics boat 02\",\"sub\":\"Docks 10:45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.8165,105.588],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Canti\",\"sub\":\"Left 09:30\"},{\"at\":[-5.959,105.493],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi\",\"sub\":\"Docks 10:45\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "A road trip with stops",
        "desc": "A BPBD relief truck route through road waypoints. Passed stops fill, the caret on the truck points the way it is heading, and each place says when in its label.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 360px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"BPBD relief truck from Bandar Lampung to Kota Agung, past Gedong Tataan, next stop Pringsewu\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.4292,105.261],[-5.406,105.205],[-5.394,105.135],[-5.3836,105.0789],[-5.37,105.025],[-5.3586,104.9746],[-5.356,104.92],[-5.353,104.879],[-5.378,104.793],[-5.418,104.755],[-5.4431,104.7266],[-5.472,104.67],[-5.4976,104.6232]],\"progress\":0.36,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"local_shipping\",\"label\":\"Truck BE 9214 CD\",\"sub\":\"Next: Pringsewu 10:20\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.4292,105.261],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"BPBD warehouse, Bandar Lampung\",\"sub\":\"Loaded 15 Nov, 07:00\"},{\"at\":[-5.3836,105.0789],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"done\":true,\"label\":\"Gedong Tataan\",\"sub\":\"Passed 15 Nov, 09:35\"},{\"at\":[-5.3586,104.9746],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"label\":\"Pringsewu\",\"sub\":\"Due 10:20\"},{\"at\":[-5.4976,104.6232],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Kota Agung\",\"sub\":\"Due 12:15\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Several places, fitted",
        "desc": "Without routes, the map fits every marker with room for the pins. Inside a scrolling page, `scrollZoom: \"modifier\"` leaves the wheel to the page and zooms only with Ctrl or Cmd held, with a short hint.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 300px; max-width: 560px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Puskesmas in Bandar Lampung\",\"scrollZoom\":\"modifier\",\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.3835,105.2785],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Way Halim\",\"sub\":\"Queue 14, open until 14:00\"},{\"at\":[-5.3758,105.2556],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Kedaton\",\"sub\":\"Quota full today\"},{\"at\":[-5.3687,105.238],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Rajabasa\",\"sub\":\"Queue 6, open until 14:00\"},{\"at\":[-5.3846,105.302],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Sukarame\",\"sub\":\"Queue 21, open until 14:00\"},{\"at\":[-5.474,105.316],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Panjang\",\"sub\":\"Queue 3, open until 21:00\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Switching records: fly to fit",
        "desc": "Calling `drawMap` again on the same element (or `handle.update`) flies the map out and back in to fit the new route, then draws the travelled part. Any drag or key stops the flight where it is.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"gap: 12px;\"><div class=\"cluster\" style=\"--gap: 8px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;BPBD logistics boat from Dermaga Canti to Pulau Sebesi, 65 percent of the way&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.65,&quot;arc&quot;:true,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;directions_boat&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Logistics boat 02&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Docks 10:45&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.8165,105.588],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Dermaga Canti&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Left 09:30&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.959,105.493],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Docks 10:45&quot;}]})\">Canti to Pulau Sebesi</button><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;BPBD relief truck from Bandar Lampung to Kota Agung, past Gedong Tataan, next stop Pringsewu&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-5.4292,105.261],[-5.406,105.205],[-5.394,105.135],[-5.3836,105.0789],[-5.37,105.025],[-5.3586,104.9746],[-5.356,104.92],[-5.353,104.879],[-5.378,104.793],[-5.418,104.755],[-5.4431,104.7266],[-5.472,104.67],[-5.4976,104.6232]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.36,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;local_shipping&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Truck BE 9214 CD&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Next: Pringsewu 10:20&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.4292,105.261],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;BPBD warehouse, Bandar Lampung&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Loaded 15 Nov, 07:00&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.3836,105.0789],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;done&quot;:true,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Gedong Tataan&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Passed 15 Nov, 09:35&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.3586,104.9746],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Pringsewu&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Due 10:20&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.4976,104.6232],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Kota Agung&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Due 12:15&quot;}]})\">Bandar Lampung to Kota Agung</button></div><div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"BPBD logistics boat from Dermaga Canti to Pulau Sebesi, 65 percent of the way\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"directions_boat\",\"label\":\"Logistics boat 02\",\"sub\":\"Docks 10:45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.8165,105.588],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Canti\",\"sub\":\"Left 09:30\"},{\"at\":[-5.959,105.493],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi\",\"sub\":\"Docks 10:45\"}]}'></div></div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"BPBD logistics boat from Dermaga Canti to Pulau Sebesi\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"directions_boat\",\"label\":\"Logistics boat 02\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.8165,105.588],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Canti\"},{\"at\":[-5.959,105.493],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi\"}]}'></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { drawMap } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  const map = drawMap(el, config);          // or let init() read data-lds-map\n  list.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    const s = shipments[e.target.closest('[data-id]').dataset.id];\n    map.update({ label: s.label, routes: s.routes, markers: s.markers });   // flies to fit\n  });\n  el.addEventListener('lds:mapselect', (e) => openShipment(e.detail.id));   // a marker was clicked\n</script>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Penyeberangan kapal yang sedang berjalan",
        "desc": "Rutenya mengikuti lingkaran besar, dilengkungkan sedikit agar terbaca sebagai penyeberangan laut. Bagian yang sudah ditempuh tergambar saat pertama terlihat, lalu kapal mengendap, menghadap sepanjang jalurnya. Seret, gulir, cubit, atau pakai tombolnya; fokuskan peta dan pakai tombol panah serta plus atau minus.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 340px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Kapal logistik BPBD dari Dermaga Canti ke Pulau Sebesi, 65 persen perjalanan\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"directions_boat\",\"label\":\"Kapal logistik 02\",\"sub\":\"Merapat 10.45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.8165,105.588],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Canti\",\"sub\":\"Berangkat 09.30\"},{\"at\":[-5.959,105.493],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi\",\"sub\":\"Merapat 10.45\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Perjalanan darat dengan pemberhentian",
        "desc": "Rute truk bantuan BPBD melewati titik-titik jalan. Pemberhentian yang sudah dilewati terisi, caret pada truk menunjuk arah tujuannya, dan setiap tempat menyebut waktunya di label.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 360px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Truk bantuan BPBD dari Bandar Lampung ke Kota Agung, sudah melewati Gedong Tataan, pemberhentian berikutnya Pringsewu\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.4292,105.261],[-5.406,105.205],[-5.394,105.135],[-5.3836,105.0789],[-5.37,105.025],[-5.3586,104.9746],[-5.356,104.92],[-5.353,104.879],[-5.378,104.793],[-5.418,104.755],[-5.4431,104.7266],[-5.472,104.67],[-5.4976,104.6232]],\"progress\":0.36,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"local_shipping\",\"label\":\"Truk BE 9214 CD\",\"sub\":\"Berikutnya: Pringsewu 10.20\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.4292,105.261],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Gudang BPBD, Bandar Lampung\",\"sub\":\"Dimuat 15 Nov, 07.00\"},{\"at\":[-5.3836,105.0789],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"done\":true,\"label\":\"Gedong Tataan\",\"sub\":\"Dilewati 15 Nov, 09.35\"},{\"at\":[-5.3586,104.9746],\"kind\":\"stop\",\"label\":\"Pringsewu\",\"sub\":\"Perkiraan 10.20\"},{\"at\":[-5.4976,104.6232],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Kota Agung\",\"sub\":\"Perkiraan 12.15\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Beberapa tempat, dipaskan",
        "desc": "Tanpa rute, peta memaskan semua marker dengan ruang untuk pinnya. Di dalam halaman yang bergulir, `scrollZoom: \"modifier\"` menyerahkan roda mouse ke halaman dan hanya memperbesar bila Ctrl atau Cmd ditahan, dengan petunjuk singkat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 300px; max-width: 560px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Puskesmas di Bandar Lampung\",\"scrollZoom\":\"modifier\",\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.3835,105.2785],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Way Halim\",\"sub\":\"Antrean 14, buka sampai 14.00\"},{\"at\":[-5.3758,105.2556],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Kedaton\",\"sub\":\"Kuota hari ini penuh\"},{\"at\":[-5.3687,105.238],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Rajabasa\",\"sub\":\"Antrean 6, buka sampai 14.00\"},{\"at\":[-5.3846,105.302],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Sukarame\",\"sub\":\"Antrean 21, buka sampai 14.00\"},{\"at\":[-5.474,105.316],\"label\":\"Puskesmas Panjang\",\"sub\":\"Antrean 3, buka sampai 21.00\"}]}'></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Berganti catatan: terbang untuk memaskan",
        "desc": "Memanggil `drawMap` lagi pada elemen yang sama (atau `handle.update`) menerbangkan peta keluar dan masuk kembali untuk memaskan rute baru, lalu menggambar bagian yang sudah ditempuh. Seret atau tombol apa pun menghentikan penerbangan di tempatnya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"gap: 12px;\"><div class=\"cluster\" style=\"--gap: 8px;\"><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Kapal logistik BPBD dari Dermaga Canti ke Pulau Sebesi, 65 persen perjalanan&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.65,&quot;arc&quot;:true,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;directions_boat&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Kapal logistik 02&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Merapat 10.45&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.8165,105.588],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Dermaga Canti&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Berangkat 09.30&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.959,105.493],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Merapat 10.45&quot;}]})\">Canti ke Pulau Sebesi</button><button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('.map')._ldsMap.handle.update({&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Truk bantuan BPBD dari Bandar Lampung ke Kota Agung, sudah melewati Gedong Tataan, pemberhentian berikutnya Pringsewu&quot;,&quot;routes&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:[[-5.4292,105.261],[-5.406,105.205],[-5.394,105.135],[-5.3836,105.0789],[-5.37,105.025],[-5.3586,104.9746],[-5.356,104.92],[-5.353,104.879],[-5.378,104.793],[-5.418,104.755],[-5.4431,104.7266],[-5.472,104.67],[-5.4976,104.6232]],&quot;progress&quot;:0.36,&quot;vehicle&quot;:{&quot;icon&quot;:&quot;local_shipping&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Truk BE 9214 CD&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Berikutnya: Pringsewu 10.20&quot;}}],&quot;markers&quot;:[{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.4292,105.261],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;origin&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Gudang BPBD, Bandar Lampung&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Dimuat 15 Nov, 07.00&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.3836,105.0789],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;done&quot;:true,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Gedong Tataan&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Dilewati 15 Nov, 09.35&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.3586,104.9746],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;stop&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Pringsewu&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Perkiraan 10.20&quot;},{&quot;at&quot;:[-5.4976,104.6232],&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;destination&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Kota Agung&quot;,&quot;sub&quot;:&quot;Perkiraan 12.15&quot;}]})\">Bandar Lampung ke Kota Agung</button></div><div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Kapal logistik BPBD dari Dermaga Canti ke Pulau Sebesi, 65 persen perjalanan\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"directions_boat\",\"label\":\"Kapal logistik 02\",\"sub\":\"Merapat 10.45\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.8165,105.588],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Canti\",\"sub\":\"Berangkat 09.30\"},{\"at\":[-5.959,105.493],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi\",\"sub\":\"Merapat 10.45\"}]}'></div></div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"map\" style=\"--map-h: 320px;\" data-lds-map='{\"label\":\"Kapal logistik BPBD dari Dermaga Canti ke Pulau Sebesi\",\"routes\":[{\"path\":[[-5.8165,105.588],[-5.959,105.493]],\"progress\":0.65,\"arc\":true,\"vehicle\":{\"icon\":\"directions_boat\",\"label\":\"Kapal logistik 02\"}}],\"markers\":[{\"at\":[-5.8165,105.588],\"kind\":\"origin\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Canti\"},{\"at\":[-5.959,105.493],\"kind\":\"destination\",\"label\":\"Dermaga Tejang, Pulau Sebesi\"}]}'></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { drawMap } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  const map = drawMap(el, config);          // or let init() read data-lds-map\n  list.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    const s = shipments[e.target.closest('[data-id]').dataset.id];\n    map.update({ label: s.label, routes: s.routes, markers: s.markers });   // flies to fit\n  });\n  el.addEventListener('lds:mapselect', (e) => openShipment(e.detail.id));   // a marker was clicked\n</script>"
